   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div><div style=\"color:#000;background-color:#fff;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Lucida Grande,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><div></div><div>Hi Efford.</div><div><br clear=\"none\"></div><div>\r\n I&#39;m thinking that, if each individual have different capture histories,\r\n so they will have different detection probabilities. I would like to \r\nestimate the detection probability for each one individual separately in\r\n relation to the traps (camera traps). I did use pdot to estimate the \r\ndetection probability at the x,y coordinates of the potential centers of\r\n activity, but I don&#39;t think that this estimate represent the \r\nprobability of that individual to be detect by the trap grid.  <br clear=\"none\"></div><div><br clear=\"none\"></div><div>Regards,</div><div><br clear=\"none\"></div>Cristiano<div><br><br></div><div style=\"display:block\">  <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Lucida Grande,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"> <div style=\"font-family:HelveticaNeue,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Lucida Grande,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"> <div dir=\"ltr\"> <font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"> <hr size=\"1\"> <b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">De:</span></b> Murray Efford &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">murray...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br> <b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Para:</span></b> secr &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">secr...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; <br><b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Cc:</span></b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">cttr...@yahoo.com.br</a><br> <b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Enviadas:</span></b> Quarta-feira, 24 de Maio de 2017 22:37<br> <b><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Assunto:</span></b> Re: detection probability of each individual<br> </font> </div> <div><br><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
