   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div><div style=\"color:#000;background-color:#fff;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Lucida Grande,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><span>Sorry to not have a better question,<br><br>I just expected that each individual could have different probability of detection, and I would like to estimate this.<br><br>I did extracted the location of the individuals using:<br><br><br>oce&lt;-fxi.contour (fit.0, i = 1:4, sessnum = 1, border = 7000, nx = 128, <br>    levels = NULL, p = seq(0.1,0.9,0.1), plt = TRUE, add = TRUE, fitmode = FALSE, plotmode = TRUE, <br>    normal = TRUE) <br>t(sapply(oce, &quot;[[&quot;, &quot;mode&quot;))<br><br><br>&gt; t(sapply(fxiout.ocelot1, &quot;[[&quot;, &quot;mode&quot;))<br>      x        y      <br> [1,] 366050.3 8910838<br> [2,] 362603.4 8914704<br> [3,] 361564.3 8916123<br> [4,] 361557.9 8916114<br><br><br>and estimated the detection of probabilities<br><br>&gt; pdot(c(366050.3, 8910838), traps,detectpar=list(g0=0.001681018, sigma=1434.234),noccasions=8)<br>[1] 0.9825371<br><br>&gt; pdot(c(362603.4, 8914704), traps,detectpar=list(g0=0.001681018, sigma=1434.234),noccasions=8)<br>[1] 0.8621421<br><br>&gt; pdot(c(361564.3, 8916123), traps,detectpar=list(g0=0.001681018, sigma=1434.234),noccasions=8)<br>[1] 0.6299537<br><br>&gt; pdot(c(361557.9, 8916114), traps,detectpar=list(g0=0.001681018, sigma=1434.234),noccasions=8)<br>[1] 0.635082<br><br>I would like to know if it is correct.<br><br>Thanks.<br></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span><br></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span>Cristiano</span></div><div><br><br></div><div style=\"display:block\">  <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Lucida Grande,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"> <div style=\"font-family:HelveticaNeue,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Lucida Grande,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"> <div dir=\"ltr\"> <font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"></font></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
